    "urlText": "Sydney Domestic Airport Station Lift between the pedestrian tunnel and the concourse is not available",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-45446",
    "content": "At Sydney Domestic Airport Station Lift between the pedestrian tunnel and the concourse is temporarily out of service.\nLift access at Domestic Airport station is not available until 20 February 2025 due to a lift upgrade. Baggage handlers are on site to assist. If you require mobility assistance you will need to go to International Terminal station. T-Bus services are available between International Airport near the Taxi Rank at arrivals and Domestic Airport outside arrivals at both T2/T3 terminals.\nIf you need help, ask staff or phone 02 8337 8450.",
